# 运行期审计日志（轮转名 admin.log.YYYYMMDD[-HHMMSS] 不被 *.log 覆盖；t260916-21 轮转产物曾被误入库 → 夹具复制它导致 GB 级副本堆积，260922 出仓）
server/admin.log*
# 协调/运行期目录（引擎自己的立场：settle 明确排除——agent_activities.SETTLE_PATHSPEC
# = [".", ":!.dsh", ":!.sandbox", ":!.sandbar", ":!.suyou"] 同族），永不入库；
# 260927 补：主仓里它们此前一直以「未跟踪」面目出现，一次 git add -A 就可能被误收。
.sandbar/
.probe-home/
# 事件账运行期目录（epic project-executor 票① t260928-13 交付：每项目 append-only
# JSONL + 轮转归档 <project>.jsonl.YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS-xxxxxx，与上一段 server/admin.log*
# 同族风险——轮转产物体积大、落地即未跟踪，一次 git add -A 就可能被误收）。260928 补。
server/ledger/
# profile 插件软链（裸包名挂载的解析面）——**必须入库**：不入库则新克隆上「挂载行在、
# 链不在」= 插件永不生效（下一次控制台重启则装载失败）。260929 实案：sandbar-watchdog
# 挂载进 cordis.patch.yml 却没落链，且仓里没有第二处会建链（installer/start-console 均无）。
!server/profile/node_modules/
!server/profile-headless/node_modules/

# Scenario run output (shots/, out/, evidence/ — t261008 gate blockage root cause,
# second recurrence was integration/t261008-36/evidence/*.png): these files are
# regenerated on every suite run; tracking them makes "run the tests" dirty main's
# worktree, and the merge gate's main-untouched check then blocks every other lane's
# merge (the 261008 three-ticket pile-up). Evidence still lands at the same paths for
# human walkthrough — it just never enters version control. Deliberately committed
# text evidence (README.md / *.py.txt in carrier dirs) stays tracked: see the
# negations below.
# evidence/ uses FILE-level rules (not a directory rule): git prunes an ignored
# directory without descending, so in-directory negations are inert; with the
# file-level form the negations fire and the two carrier directories stay
# un-ignored. Those carriers are NOT run output — they are hand-preserved
# quarantined deliverables (see their README), so they must remain trackable.
# (t261008-50: this block supersedes the main-side hotfix rules
# integration/*/shots/*.png and integration/*/evidence/*.png — directory-level
# coverage, so non-png strays count too.)
integration/*/shots/
integration/*/out/
integration/*/evidence/*
!integration/t261004-25/evidence/*
!integration/t261004-28/evidence/*

# t261026-23 的内容 stamp 是**构建产物**（每次跑 build-client.sh 都会重写），
# 不是源码：落包根而非 lib/（lib 有字节守卫会把它当漂移）。它必须被忽略，
# 否则任何跑过构建的泳道都会带着一个写集之外的未被跟踪文件，merge_check
# 的 foreign-file 面直接判红（实测 t261026-26 因此连续两次落不了地）。
server/plugins/workbench/.build-stamp.json
